  "bestPractices": [
    "ui.grudge-studio.com is SSOT — do not host third main-panel/spellbook on random domains",
    "Warlords/grudge6 chrome = craftpix fantasy; VoxGrudge can use Kenney pixel",
    "Interactive input in game client; packs are chrome + layout + bindData",
    "Prefer ObjectStore + assets CDN skill icons; craftpix Icons 128 as chrome fallback only",
    "Profession headers = profession_game_icon; backgrounds = grudgewarlords.com/assets/professions",
